    <p style="color:var(--c-ink-soft);">Version 0.1 · public preview · last updated 2026-07-09</p>

    <h2>Free means free</h2>
    <p>All learning content on this platform is free, with no paywalls, paid
    tiers, or paid certificates — as a standing commitment, not a promotion.</p>

