    in the public repository. You are explicitly welcome to fork all of it.</p>

    <h2>What this isn't</h2>
    <p>Course content is education about AI tools and concepts. It is not
    legal, medical, financial, or professional advice, and third-party tools
    it describes change frequently — verify specifics against official
    documentation (our lessons teach exactly this habit).</p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>The platform is provided as-is, in active development, without
    warranties of any kind. We aim for accuracy and mark every lesson and
    tool card with a verification date so you can judge freshness yourself.</p>

    <h2>Be decent</h2>
    <p>Don't abuse the service, attempt to disrupt it for others, or
    misrepresent your relationship with the project. That's the whole list.</p>
